---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Explore Northern Michigan · TVC Cherry Capital Airport Gateway"
  description="TVC is your gateway to Traverse City, Sleeping Bear Dunes National Lakeshore, Grand Traverse Bay, regional wineries, championship golf, and winter sports."
>
  <div class="page-header-bg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <span>Explore Northern Michigan</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="page-title">Land Closer to What Matters</h1>
      <p class="page-intro">Step off your flight and arrive straight into the heart of Northern Michigan's lakes, dunes, wineries, and vibrant towns.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="visit-section">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- Disclaimer Banner -->
      <div class="disclaimer-banner tvc-card mb-8">
        ℹ️ <strong>Brand & Creative Coordination Note:</strong> This prototype showcases existing public imagery and regional assets to demonstrate information architecture. Final brand identity, photography, and destination storytelling will be produced in coordination with NRAA's creative agency partner.
      </div>

      <!-- Regional Destinations Grid -->
      <div class="dest-gallery-grid">
        <div class="gallery-card tvc-card">
          <div class="g-img">
            <img src="/media/northern-michigan/sleeping-bear-dunes-michigan.jpg" alt="Sleeping Bear Dunes National Lakeshore" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" />
          </div>
          <div class="g-content">
            <span class="g-dist">35 Miles from TVC</span>
            <h3>Sleeping Bear Dunes National Lakeshore</h3>
            <p>Voted 'Most Beautiful Place in America'. Miles of freshwater sand dunes towering 450 feet over Lake Michigan, hiking trails, and historic maritime villages.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-card tvc-card">
          <div class="g-img">
            <img src="/media/northern-michigan/beautiful-sunrise-reflected-in-big-forest-lake-8959QAL.jpg" alt="Northern Michigan Lakes and Wineries" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" />
          </div>
          <div class="g-content">
            <span class="g-dist">12 Miles from TVC</span>
            <h3>Old Mission & Leelanau Wine Regions</h3>
            <p>Over 40 award-winning wineries, craft breweries, and cideries along the 45th parallel, offering panoramic bay views and wine tasting tours.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-card tvc-card">
          <div class="g-img">
            <img src="/media/airport/Threetops-Resort.jpg" alt="Northern Michigan Championship Golf Resorts" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" />
          </div>
          <div class="g-content">
            <span class="g-dist">5 to 25 Miles from TVC</span>
            <h3>Championship Golf Courses</h3>
            <p>Home to premier golf resorts designed by Jack Nicklaus, Arnold Palmer, and Tom Weiskopf nestled among hardwoods and freshwater lakes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-card tvc-card">
          <div class="g-img">
            <img src="/media/northern-michigan/tc-visitors-bureau.jpg" alt="Downtown Traverse City Dining & Culture" loading="lazy" width="600" height="400" />
          </div>
          <div class="g-content">
            <span class="g-dist">4 Miles from TVC</span>
            <h3>Downtown Traverse City Dining & Culture</h3>
            <p>Independent boutiques, farm-to-table culinary spots, Front Street shopping, the historic State Theatre, and vibrant waterfront festivals.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Partner Tourism Resources Bar -->
      <div class="partner-bar tvc-card mt-12">
        <div class="partner-text">
          <h3>Plan Your Northern Michigan Itinerary</h3>
          <p>Cherry Capital Airport works closely with regional tourism organizations to connect travelers with hotels, events, and seasonal activities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="partner-links">
          <a href="https://www.traversecity.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-navy">Traverse City Tourism ↗</a>
          <a href="https://www.michigan.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline">Pure Michigan ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-navy-dark) 0%, var(--color-navy) 100%); color: white; padding: 40px 0; }
  .breadcrumb { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94A3B8; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: #CBD5E1; }
  .page-title { font-size: 2.5rem; color: white; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .page-intro { color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 1.05rem; }

  .visit-section { padding: 40px 0 80px; }

  .disclaimer-banner { background: #FFFBEB; border-color: #F59E0B; color: #92400E; font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 32px; }

  .dest-gallery-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr); gap: 24px; }
  @media (min-width: 768px) { .dest-gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }

  .gallery-card { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .g-img { height: 220px; width: 100%; }
  .g-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }

  .g-content { padding: 20px; }
  .g-dist { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-cherry); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .g-content h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--color-navy-dark); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .g-content p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }

  .mt-12 { margin-top: 48px; }
  .partner-bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; background: var(--color-sand); }
  .partner-text h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--color-navy-dark); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .partner-text p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .partner-links { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>
